      "name": "`memory_secrets` and the CLI’s `secrets --folder ID|root`…",
      "text": "`memory_secrets` and the CLI’s `secrets --folder ID|root` list one folder. Creating a secret accepts a folder, and `memory_move_secret` or `move-secret ID --folder ID|root --version N` moves one. The bundled agent skill suggests grouping secrets in provider or purpose folders and offers to tidy loose secrets only with your approval.",
